last_batch: Toolbar "📦 Publish" button split into two siblings — **🔖 Release** (primary, amber tint, opens openReleaseModal() = same destination as Ship → Folio → Release, just one-click shortcut) and **📄 Print** (ghost secondary, opens openPOD() for POD vendors). POD modal heading renamed "📦 Print & Publish" → "📄 Print edition" so vocabulary is consistent: Release = digital, Print = paperback. Previously a new user clicking the biggest toolbar button to "publish my book" landed on trim-size readiness checks for KDP/IngramSpark/Lulu. Logged in docs/CANONICAL_FEATURES.md as a new feature entry.
